{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4e9df607-c4c2-576b-a9d8-7751f086a094", "source_ordinal": 3092, "reading_ordinal": 960, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "印刷信息量", "published_at": "2021-09-07T00:16:48+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/483838337/answer/2106843482"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "在平面印刷上最有效记载数据的手段，目前来说是二维码。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不是简单的“用彩色”就行，还要考虑容错性/可靠性。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "目前来说，现在的二维码技术在这个主题上是考虑得最成熟的。它其实远超过一般人的日常认知。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果人类要永久保留某种信息，其实最好的选择是用二维码物理保存。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "随手查一下：", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "二维码信息容量是多少？", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 149}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-09/06/65a1a75e14ab5b082fc5b8822855e091.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9, "image": 1}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 138, "sample": "二维码信息容量是多少？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：用 A4 纸记录一个 G 的数据需要多少钱？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“印刷信息量”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“在平面印刷上最有效记载数据的手段，目前来说是二维码。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "在平面印刷上最有效记载数据的手段，目前来说是二维码。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1bb8d250-88cf-5ef3-8d94-493059bcaeb0", "source_ordinal": 3091, "reading_ordinal": 961, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "挖掘隐私", "published_at": "2021-09-07T18:18:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/35228461/answer/2108156131"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这条红线不是“某一类信息你可以挖、某一类你不能挖”，而是看“许可”的——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "对方没告诉你的，你自己最好不要挖。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "最高境界是查都不去查，如果你到不了这么高的境界，自己忍不住要查，那么查了你最好自己忍住别乱说。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "对方的安全感主要来自ta可以自己掌握你了解ta的深度和广度。你知道什么、不知道什么，ta应该有心理准备。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "举个例子，对方主动邀请你看ta的QQ空间，那么你才可以认为QQ空间的所有内容是允许你知情的；对方没邀请，你最好不要自己去翻。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果你不确定到底有没有这授权，你可以直接明确的申请。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不经对方主动告知或者允许，自己去打探和挖掘这些东西，不管你打探的是什么，都会造成对方在信息上的劣势——也就是出现“ta不知道你知道”的问题。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这会让对方大感被动，并对你们的关系感到非常不乐观。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为你既然不遵守这个约束，那么你还会往下深挖多少，就是无法预料的。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "必须严肃的警告你们——某些人也许身负某种黑暗的秘密，按你这个挖法，对方没有把握确保你不会挖到，甚至可能对你起杀心。", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你没准会无意间挖出个杀身之祸。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "比如对方其实是个潜逃多年的罪犯，看似只是个平平常常的搞装修的经理。", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "谁晓得你老人家情报能力惊人，从口音、体态、姓氏、年龄、籍贯，各种反求，顺口问一句“是不是xx中学毕业的”。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你以为是套近乎，搞不好变成莫名不知去向的失踪人口。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以，万事不要追问、不要深挖。要记得对方主动跟你说过什么，跟人交谈，以此为界，不要乱越界。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这不光是个小姐姐喜不喜欢你的问题，而且还是行走江湖会不会莫名其妙把命丢了的问题，", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别说不要深挖，就是对方自己想要告诉你，老江湖们都不要听。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "听了就成了知情人，就要多操一份心、多挂一根弦、多一份忌讳——这都是只要交往起来就要持续付出的无限持续的成本。", "char_start": 681, "char_end": 735}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "对有完整自尊、高度自足、不准备占便宜而是准备付出的人来说，深挖别人的隐私老实说是一种损失。", "char_start": 736, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "反过来，对ta人来说，你深挖隐私，就意味着你不是“完整自尊、高度自足、不准备占便宜而是准备付出的人”。", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 833}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "谁想跟这样的人搭上关系？", "char_start": 834, "char_end": 846}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "如果你不打算当天煞孤星，你装也要装成前者，看懂了吗？", "char_start": 847, "char_end": 873}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何界定隐私的界限？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“挖掘隐私”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这条红线不是“某一类信息你可以挖、某一类你不能挖”，而是看“许可”的——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这条红线不是“某一类信息你可以挖、某一类你不能挖”，而是看“许可”的——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f2f28830-036c-5c78-b946-6b019938238b", "source_ordinal": 3090, "reading_ordinal": 962, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "年轻并不好", "published_at": "2021-09-08T02:13:27+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/484057801/answer/2108746048"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人们太希望表达大量“前所未有”的激情。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不新造一个不存在的词，怎么能配得上这从未有过的超超超超级新震撼呢？", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "逻辑不是很顺吗？", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“新“太重要了，哪怕只是一张新的皮也好，让自己感觉到自己始终和“全新”的站在一起，才能摆脱某种“我已经过时、即将被埋葬”的恐惧。", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其实，真正的恐惧恰恰是来自这个“不断追赶新潮头才能击退自己的生存恐惧”的循环本身——因为你知道自己不可能永远当这个弄潮儿。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你只是现在还当得起而已。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只有站在潮头才有安全感，而你知道自己不可能一直站在潮头。越是知道这事总要结束、越是要强迫性的追赶下一个潮头。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "无穷无尽。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "其实，只有你可以不必追赶这些潮头、也能安然的看到自己的出路和生机的状态，你才是真的活着了。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不使用这些“潮语”，也能吸引人聚拢来，才叫真的聚拢人。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这种能力都是试出来的，你最好早点开始试。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "什么时候试成了，你什么时候就不再恐惧自己“不再年轻”了。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "“年轻”并没有任何特别的好处，它只是有很多豁免权，但是它本身并不美好。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人是要成熟了，才真正开始享受人生。", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "越早成熟越好，最好少年老成。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 456}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：媒体批「yyds」「绝绝子」等网络用语，称人们离开「梗」就不会说话了，网络用语真的会影响表达能力吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“年轻并不好”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人们太希望表达大量“前所未有”的激情。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人们太希望表达大量“前所未有”的激情。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3f40373a-5ff6-5034-9545-f2a2ae38d71e", "source_ordinal": 3089, "reading_ordinal": 963, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "悲欣交集", "published_at": "2021-09-08T13:20:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/447908937/answer/2109394187"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "年轻的时候都快被毫无情节的学校生活逼疯了，急需戏剧性，只愁自己不是主角。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "中年的时候都快被天降戏码的人海沉浮整怕了，跪求安宁感，只恨自己不是看客。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 73}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-09/08/241bc17e615e2c18bd8a2719109c8f79.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 4, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么我会时不时脑补一些理智完全丧失的疯狂场景？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002"], "summary": "围绕“悲欣交集”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“年轻的时候都快被毫无情节的学校生活逼疯了，急需戏剧性，只愁自己不是主角。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "年轻的时候都快被毫无情节的学校生活逼疯了，急需戏剧性，只愁自己不是主角。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "550b55cc-125d-5989-b69b-1d76045f01e6", "source_ordinal": 3088, "reading_ordinal": 964, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无知的责任", "published_at": "2021-09-08T13:41:44+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/485263076/answer/2109427875"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "无知在人是无罪的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "是给你责任、授予你权力的人要为你的无知自负其责。你因为无知犯的错，责任其实在指定你去做这事的人。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "无知在天是罪。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你不知道要在涨潮之前上岸或者不知道掉下悬崖会死，结果死在海滩上、悬崖下了，那就是且仅是你自己的责任。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "将来你会知道的——其实在人有罪无罪是次要的，在天有罪无罪才是决定性的。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "在天无罪的事，人强行给它定一个罪，往往徒具虚名、实际上只能睁只眼闭只眼。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "在天有罪的事，人强行要说无罪，往往帝国倒塌、社会崩溃、全员陪葬。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "被人认定为有罪，其实只是天降罪责的形式之一，其实前者是不能与后者并列的。", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以以后考虑一个事情到底有罪无罪，先从“是否有足够强大的可持续性”这个角度出发考虑，再去考虑人类的法律怎么看待这问题。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而后者建议你直接问律师和法官。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 336}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：无知是恶吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“无知的责任”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“无知在人是无罪的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "无知在人是无罪的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d6cfe09b-09c8-5fa2-9ef9-b4fd1578eabf", "source_ordinal": 3087, "reading_ordinal": 965, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "富得不幸福", "published_at": "2021-09-08T17:27:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/438976773/answer/2109868337"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "个人资产近4000万，月薪16万，还要加上：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）你还让周围起码4个人以上资产过500万、月薪过4万——或者16个人资产过百万、月薪过万，数字你自己倒腾；", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）没有人因为你们的富有而亏损或受辱。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你才能放心感到幸福，而且基本上你不感受到某种幸福是不太可能的。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果没有这两条，你何止不该感受到幸福，你应该感受到不安和害怕。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "在你不知道的地方，怕是有眼睛正在看着你。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如何树立正确的财富观？", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 195}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 184, "sample": "如何树立正确的财富观？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么个人资产近4000万，月薪16万，却没有感受到生活的幸福呢 ？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“富得不幸福”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“个人资产近4000万，月薪16万，还要加上：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "个人资产近4000万，月薪16万，还要加上：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4fb2efbb-9757-5049-bc9c-8dca10f4383a", "source_ordinal": 3086, "reading_ordinal": 966, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "世故", "published_at": "2021-09-09T02:28:21+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/485637923/answer/2110559073"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "世故的人没种。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "而没种的人根本没机会理性。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "理性的人要经常需要仅仅凭着对逻辑的信仰坚信这风意味着九曲十八弯的尽头必有出口，无视庸人惊恐的尖叫和咒骂，朝着伸手不见五指的黑暗走出去。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不要以为会“算”的人就叫“理性”。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "每年会算的毕业千千万万，带种只是少数。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta们自己第一不敢相信自己计算的结果，第二也根本不敢算到底。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta们拿着计算器，只是想证明自己的软弱是最佳选择。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些人老了，就叫世故。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 196}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：世故和理性的本质区别是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“世故”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“世故的人没种。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "世故的人没种。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7b72a9f0-61e2-563d-8d25-2a5788f6fe88", "source_ordinal": 3085, "reading_ordinal": 967, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "反恐", "published_at": "2021-09-09T02:41:37+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/383702182/answer/2110563577"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“女拳”的手段很简单，就是舆论恐怖主义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "恐怖分子砍伤炸伤了路人。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "路人又惊又怕，只要一时三刻，这种“完全可能是我”的恐惧就会转为群情激愤。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "路人开始集结部队，派出无人机猛烈轰炸恐怖分子的街区。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "误伤了谁，哪有“正义复仇”重要？", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“难道对待恐怖分子还不应该坚决轰炸？”", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "然后下一步的剧情是“恐怖分子被消灭了”吗？", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是吗？", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "是被炸的人排队加入恐怖组织，恐怖分子拿到大量的捐款。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "恐怖分子最希望你轰炸，搞你的目的就是为了引你轰炸，要的就是你赶紧炸，炸多点、炸狠点。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你越投票支持那些高呼“轰炸”的“国会议员”，去“志愿报名参战”，去轰炸“恐怖分子基地”，越有利于谁？", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "有利于你自己？", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "还是有利于“国会议员”和ta的朋友们？", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "还有利于恐怖分子们？！", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "现在泛滥的所谓“反女拳”，实际上是什么思路？要用“正义的”舆论恐怖主义来压倒“邪恶的”舆论恐怖主义。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "誓要比恐怖分子更恐怖。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "以为以“舆论恐怖主义”的魔法反对舆论恐怖主义的魔法，就可以“抵消”？", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这思路就跟“只要更猛烈地轰炸阿富汗就能消灭塔利班”一样的愚蠢。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "为什么叫你们不要“反女拳”？因为“女拳”就是你们这种“反”法反出来的！", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "阿富汗怎么丢的？", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "“反女拳”就是用实际行动为女拳输送血液！", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这一点都想不通，还键政个啥？", "char_start": 521, "char_end": 535}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0157"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：知乎上大量的所谓以反“女拳师”抹黑女权行为是否得当？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“反恐”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““女拳”的手段很简单，就是舆论恐怖主义。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“女拳”的手段很简单，就是舆论恐怖主义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
